  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Children are protected - Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening child protection systems and support work to strengthen response and prevention services as well as systems and mechanisms at local, regional and national levels. Engage with local civil society to advocate for improved national policies and legal measures. Other Partners: TASS, CACP, PUNSAA, SOSCENSA, SCRC, SONUT, PDON, Puntland Youth Association Network (PYAN)</narrative>
  </description>
